rt;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QtAby4PDIhaBUVyjf2iaaezbicysE9KElnxY4shKR3NWCzpvMUqqCfjDtmRB675h4IgZ3383nibyJiaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于这个批次\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Bonga庄园位于南部部族洲最西边的Keffa区域，它也是我们所有阿拉比卡咖啡的发源地；Bonga占地700公顷，有90个合同工人，350个季节帮工，是当地较大的咖啡庄园。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QtAby4PDIhaBUVyjf2iaaeztat7E5NTdfZNpOgURNibI5JCInPbqXbCA9u0rbIBLAzOAU1pzGhjiayw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多咖啡，请进入小程序选购哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 253px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
